<title>FRANCE: TENNIS-GRAF BEATS LUCIC TO TAKE STRASBOURG TITLE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-GRAF BEATS LUCIC TO TAKE STRASBOURG TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>STRASBOURG, France 1997-05-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of final in the Strasbourg women's tournament on Saturday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>1-Steffi Graf (Germany) beat Mirjana Lucic (Croatia) 6-2 7-5.</p>
</text>
